        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: How to Survive a Plague\n- Places: St. Patrick's Cathedral, New York City, United States\n- Events: 1989 demonstration during mass\n- Topics: Neo-Gothic architecture, Roman Catholic cathedrals\n\nFacts:\n- In 1989, a demonstration took place during mass at St. Patrick's Cathedral.\n- The film How to Survive a Plague includes footage of the 1989 demonstration during mass at St. Patrick's Cathedral.\n- How to Survive a Plague opened in select theatres across the United States on September 21, 2012.\n- St. Patrick's Cathedral, formally the Cathedral of St. Patrick, is a decorated Neo-Gothic-style Roman Catholic cathedral church in the United States.\n- St. Patrick's Cathedral is a prominent landmark of New York City.",
